      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِلْقَطٌ</span></b>  <i>A thing with which,</i> (K,) or <i>in which,</i>
(Jm,) <i>one picks up,</i> or <i>takes up, from the ground:</i>
(Jm, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِلْقَاطٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

